---
args: {"bridges": "MeaningBridge[]", "senses": "OperationalSense[]", "inquiry": "IntegrationInquiry"}
returns: "RoleHandoff[]"
---
For each supported operational bridge trace the source responsibility and destination expectation. Record trigger, payload meaning, acceptance condition, authority basis and named role acceptance. Identify both duplicated ownership and unowned steps. When personnel access is absent, use role-level representations and a restricted identity-resolution request; never infer employees from private source hints. An explicit rejected definition retains its team-specific process boundary and cannot produce an accepted shared handoff.
